Common Docker and Kubernetes exit codes
Exit code	Meaning	Common reason
0	Success	Container completed normally
1	General error	Application failure or script error
2	Misuse of command	Invalid arguments or incorrect command usage
125	Docker execution error	Docker daemon or docker run failure
126	Cannot execute	Permission denied or command not executable
127	Command not found	Executable missing or incorrect path
128	Invalid exit argument	Invalid exit status in some shell contexts
130	Interrupted (SIGINT)	Ctrl+C
134	Aborted (SIGABRT)	Application abort
137	Killed (SIGKILL)	OOMKilled or forced termination
139	Segmentation fault (SIGSEGV)	Invalid memory access
143	Terminated (SIGTERM)	Graceful shutdown request
255	Exit status 255	Application-specific failure or runtime error
